# 1.2: MIDI CCs (Penumbra's idea, our own code), on any channel, USB and the TRS jack. 16-19: the four knobs of the
# page on screen. 74-79: Filter, Evolve, Motion, Drift, Wet and Energy, whatever the page. 0..127 across the knob's
# range (the centred ones: 64 is 0). A touch, as a note. Never Save, nor Setup's Tune, MIDI out or Lights
wait 500
expect view 0
expect store_writes 0
# HOME's four: Filter, Evolve, Motion, Drift
midi B0 11 7F
wait 50
expect par5 100
expect dirty 1
midi B0 10 00
wait 50
expect mac0 -50
midi B0 10 40
wait 50
expect mac0 0
# any channel (6 here); Drift's 0..6, 64 its middle
midi B5 12 00
wait 50
expect par15 0
midi B5 13 40
wait 50
expect par6 3
midi BF 13 7F
wait 50
expect par6 6
# another page: its own four (the Drone's: Pedal first)
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
midi B0 10 00
wait 50
expect par40 0
expect par5 100
# 74-79, whatever the page
midi B0 4A 7F
wait 50
expect mac0 50
midi B0 4B 00
wait 50
expect par5 0
midi B0 4C 7F
wait 50
expect par15 100
midi B0 4D 00
wait 50
expect par6 0
midi B0 4E 7F
wait 50
expect mac1 50
midi B0 4F 00
wait 50
expect mac2 -50
expect view 1
# other CCs: nothing (the mod wheel, volume, 80)
midi B0 01 7F
midi B0 07 00
midi B0 50 7F
wait 50
expect par40 0
expect par5 0
expect mac0 50
# Setup: Tune, MIDI out, Lights and Save never by a CC; nothing saved
tap GLO
wait 300
expect view 6
midi B0 10 00
midi B0 11 00
midi B0 12 00
midi B0 13 7F
wait 300
expect par16 0
expect par17 1
expect store_writes 0
